  sig=func (m *Manager) Provision(ctx context.Context, req Request) (Info, error)
  doc=Provision brings up (or replaces) the preview for a conversation. It emits\npreview.pending immediately, then preview.ready with the proxied URL on\nsuccess or preview.failed with an honest reason on any failure. It is\nsynchronous; the engine calls it from a goroutine on plan completion or from\nthe re-preview route.
